    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d739">

                <pb facs="0524" n="452" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg452"/>

                <head>Milan Workingmen’s Mutual Help Association</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Milan</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-17">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 17, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Brothers of the United States of America:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Our grief for the death of Lincoln is as great as our faith in the triumph of the
                    cause for which you fight. The holiness of your cause is equal to the greatness
                    of its martyr.</p>
                <p>For the Working Men’s Mutual Help Association in Milan,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>MONDOLFO, <hi rendition="#italic">President</hi>.</item>
                            <item>FILIPPO BUIDA, <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vice-President</hi>,<lb/>And many others.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
